## snag-1 — 2026-04-28 12:42
Decision: Used the cropped PNGs at h-7 sm:h-8 (28-32px tall in the h-16 nav)
Alternatives considered: render at h-10 (40px), h-8 (32px) only
Reason: at ~5:1 aspect ratio the wordmark needs to feel light, not dominating. h-8 width ≈ 160px sits naturally beside the nav links without crowding.
