## snag-4 / new card stats — 2026-04-28 13:10
Decision: Card 7 (Proof) has no stat. Card 8 (Keeping up) has stat = "£7.50/mo" / "Stay Current after the first three months".
Alternatives considered: add a "104" or "Top 1%" stat to the Proof card.
Reason: A card-level "104" stat would clash with the hero device mock's example score also showing 104 — visitors would think the score on the page is the same one. The Stay Current price IS a stat in the sense of being a memorable number, and it directly maps to the pricing tier.
Risk: stat-less Proof card may look visually lighter than its row-mates — but the body copy is dense enough to compensate.
